  "description": "A 17th century colonial setting based in the americas, based on a simplified but history based map of north and south america in 1750. Leaders are colonial govenors, or in the case of tribes, trival chiefs. The player takes on one of these leaders, eager to expand and develop their colony. Colonies recieve occasional demands from their colonial overlords in europe which they must handle, as well as various plausible period politics between colonies, natives etc.",
